{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB藝人吳嘉儀（阿七）2023年與圈外男友「豬仔」Leo結婚，惟新婚四個月便曾於網上公審老公，爆門鎖密碼被改令她無家可歸，婚姻關係惹揣測。</p><p>事隔多時，吳嘉儀前日（12日）透過社交平台宣布正辦理離婚手續，更驚爆多年來飽受對方暴力損毀物品、家</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:26.831534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:45.250993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:45.250993+00:00","content_hash":"2590306b51f625a782521fa7719d2552483d2b5d739509661d69fb9bea079796","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}